  "title": "Index: G–K",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "manual-574-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "This index page continues the Volume I reference list with entries under G, H, I, J, and K. It includes Gurbax Dass, Gurbilas, Gurdas Nangal, Guru Amar Das, Guru Angad Dev, Guru Arjan Dev, and Guru Gobind Singh."
    },
    {
      "id": "manual-574-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The entries also point to Guru Granth Sahib, Guru Hargobind, Guru Harkrishan, Guru Har Rai, Guru Nanak, Guru Ram Das, Guru Tegh Bahadur, Himmat Singh, Jiwan Singh Ranghreta, and Jujhar Singh."
    },
    {
      "id": "manual-574-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The lower section begins the K entries, including Kaaba, Kabul, Kaithal, Kaliyuga, Kangar, Karnal, Kashi, and Kaur Singh. This page is a reference aid, not a continuation of Episode 81."
    }
  ],
